      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Project**\n\nI'm solidifying the initial architecture, I will use Google's Gemini API for summarization. The next step is coding the summarization file, `summarize_text.py`, to interact with Gemini. I need to integrate API key handling for the LLM. I'm focusing on simplicity and clarity.\n\n\n**Refining the Implementation**\n\nI've determined I'll use Google's Gemini through the `google.generativeai` library. I'm now structuring `summarize_text.py` with a summarization function. I'll include the API key and model name for provider identification. The next thing I'll do is add the specific summarization function. I'm prioritizing directness and a clear API key setup.\n\n\n",
